+# Errata to the paper (P3) and its verification package
+
+*The paper is frozen after its ninth draft: its text is not rewritten, and what is to be read otherwise is entered here.
+Entered 2026-11-13: the words of the project's working record that stand in the paper and in its verification
+package's README, each with the plain reading. None changes a statement of the paper. Each row names the file, the
+line, the words as printed (a part of that line, word for word), and how to read them.*
+
+| file | line | as printed | read as |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| `papers/P3_THE_PAPER/main.tex` | 28 | keeps the owner's | keeps the author's (a comment of the source, not printed) |
+| `papers/P3_THE_PAPER/main.tex` | 1249 | interval-certified at $100$ and $160$ bits by a second seat | interval-certified at 100 and 160 bits by a second, independent computation |
+| `papers/P3_THE_PAPER/main.tex` | 1436 | the lane that held that | the working line that held that |
+| `papers/P3_THE_PAPER/main.tex` | 1769 | withdrawn on another seat's correction | withdrawn on another working line's correction |
+| `papers/P3_THE_PAPER/verification_package/README.md` | 83 | expect about 3457 on main | expect about 3457 on the repository's default branch |
